    {
      "accreditor": "MSCHE",
      "action_type": "adverse_action",
      "action_label": "To acknowledge receipt of the teach-out plan and teach-out agreement. To approve the teach-out agreement with Montclair State University, Montclair, NY and to note that student records, programs, and services will transfer from Bloomfield College to Montclair State University. The purpose of the teach-out is to provide for the equitable treatment of students to complete their education or transfer to a new institution as a result of the transaction. To require that the institution complete and submit for approval, due August 15, 2023, an updated teach-out plan that must include: (1) signed teach-out agreements, including any documentation supporting the agreements, to cover all academic programs; (2) evidence that required notifications to all relevant stakeholders have taken place; (3) evidence that the institution has notified students of any additional charges; (4) evidence that communications regarding student records has occurred; and (5) evidence that financial aid counseling has been conducted (Teach-Out Plan and Agreements Policy and Procedures). To note that Bloomfield College's accreditation will cease on June 30, 2024. To note that Montclair State University, Upper Montclair, NJ has been designated as the repository of all Bloomfield College student records. To require notification when student records have been transferred to Montclair State University by email to [email protected]. To note the action for Montclair State University on June 22, 2023.",
